# Copy to .env before `docker compose up -d`.
#
# Most configuration is in config/opencode.json (providers, MCP servers, etc.)
# and backend/.env (platform settings). This file is the top-level override for
# docker-compose variables — and it is where the OpenViking secrets live.
#
# `.env` is gitignored. Never commit real values here.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenViking (required — the `openviking` service will not start without them)
#
# docker-compose interpolates these into the service's `environment:`, and
# OpenViking's own config loader expands the matching ${VAR} placeholders inside
# openviking/ov.conf (os.path.expandvars). That is why ov.conf can be committed
# while the keys cannot.
#
#   OV_ROOT_API_KEY      Server root key. Held by the backend ONLY, used to mint
#                        per-user keys via /api/v1/admin/*. In `api_key` mode the
#                        root key is path-restricted to the admin plane, so it
#                        cannot read any user's memories even if it leaks.
#                        Generate: openssl rand -hex 32
#   OV_EMBEDDING_API_KEY API key for the dense embedding provider (Aliyun MaaS,
#                        qwen3.7-text-embedding, 1024-d).
#   OV_VLM_API_KEY       API key for the VLM used to build L0/L1 summaries
#                        (Volcengine API Gateway, glm-5.3-flash).
#
# Rotating OV_ROOT_API_KEY invalidates every existing key; rotating the other
# two only breaks indexing/summarisation until the new value is in place.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
OV_ROOT_API_KEY=
OV_EMBEDDING_API_KEY=
OV_VLM_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenViking rerank (OPTIONAL — leave empty to keep rerank disabled)
#
#   OV_RERANK_API_KEY    Aliyun Model Studio key for the rerank model
#                        (gte-rerank-v2 via DashScope's native rerank path).
#                        Empty = rerank off, retrieval stays vector-only.
#                        OV_EMBEDDING_API_KEY works here too when it belongs to
#                        an Aliyun Model Studio account; use a separate key if
#                        you want to rotate or rate-limit rerank independently.
#
# The endpoint, model and threshold are config-as-code in openviking/ov.conf.
# This is the only knob, and it is a key rather than a URL on purpose — see the
# comment on OV_RERANK_API_KEY in docker-compose.yml for why an empty api_base
# would be misdetected as the Cohere provider.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
OV_RERANK_API_KEY=
